{
    "id":  3525,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "DARK Concrete Pendant Lamp - Industrial style - E14",
    "reference":  "91111",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003eDARK concrete pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e is an ideal choice for creating an \u003cstrong\u003eindustrial\u003c/strong\u003e and modern atmosphere in any \u003cstrong\u003einterior\u003c/strong\u003e space. Its simple and minimalist design makes it adaptable to any style of decoration, and its adjustable height allows you to adapt it to your needs. In addition, its use of industrial materials makes it a robust and durable option.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBring personality and make a difference in the \u003cstrong\u003edecoration of your rooms and trendy places\u003c/strong\u003e with these concrete pendant lamps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e* Cable adjustable in height\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDARK Concrete Pendant Lamp - Industrial style - E14\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eIndustrial and modern lighting for any space\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003econcrete pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eindustrial\u003c/strong\u003e style, \u003cstrong\u003eE14\u003c/strong\u003e socket and gray color is an industrial and modern option for any interior space. Its simple and minimalist design adapts to any style of decoration, from classic to modern. This type of \u003cstrong\u003esecondary light\u003c/strong\u003e, is special to give a decorative touch to professional spaces to give an attractive and \u003cstrong\u003epleasant\u003c/strong\u003e touch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis luminaire is made of high quality concrete material, with a gray finish that gives it a modern and sophisticated look. The suspension cable is adjustable, up to a maximum of 145cm, so you can adapt the height of the lamp to your needs. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003elamp\u003c/strong\u003e supports bulbs with \u003cstrong\u003eE14\u003c/strong\u003e socket, so you can choose the one that best suits your lighting needs. LED bulbs are an ideal choice, as they are energy efficient and produce a warm, pleasant light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED lighting elements such as the\u003cstrong\u003e DARK pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e allow us to create cozy spaces that give life to every corner of the room. We can use it alone or combine several lamps at \u003cstrong\u003edifferent heights\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a very attractive set visually.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts unique design and solid construction make it a durable and sturdy piece that can provide illumination and style for many years to come.  The advantages of using concrete in lighting: \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete is a tough and durable material, which means concrete pendant lights have a long life span and can withstand daily wear and tear.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete has a unique texture and appearance that can add an industrial touch to the decor of a space. Concrete pendant lights for LED lighting have a unique aesthetic that can make a design statement.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete pendant lights for LED lighting can be customized with different finishes, such as pigments, textures and patterns, to suit any decor style. It is a material that allows you to easily customize it, or paint it to your liking. \u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e* Bulb NOT INCLUDED\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the DARK Concrete Pendant Lamp - Industrial style - E14\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eindustrial kitchens\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eoffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eliving rooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003erestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ebars\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ecafeterias\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
